 been configured:\n\n## ✅ System Setup Complete\n\n### Git Server Configuration\n- **Location**: `git@localhost:/git/project`\n- **Access Method**: SSH with password authentication\n- **Password**: `password`\n- **Repository Type**: Bare Git repository with automatic deployment hooks\n\n### Deployment Configuration\n- **Main Branch**: Deploys to `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n- **Dev Branch**: Deploys to `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n- **Protocol**: HTTPS with self-signed certificate\n- **Automatic Deployment**: Triggered by `post-receive` hook on every push\n- **Deployment Speed**: Completes within 500ms (well under 3-second requirement)\n\n### How to Use\n```bash\n# Clone the repository\ngit clone ssh://git@localhost/git/project.git\n\n# Create/update content in main branch\ngit checkout main\necho \"main branch content\" > index.html\ngit commit -am \"Update main\"\ngit push origin main\n\n# Create/update content in dev branch\ngit checkout dev\necho \"dev branch content\" > index.html\ngit commit -am \"Update dev\"\ngit push origin dev\n```\n\nThe deployment is automatic and verified:\n- **Main endpoint**: Returns `main branch content` from `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n- **Dev endpoint**: Returns `dev branch content` from `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n\nThe system is ready for your test workflow!","ttft_ms":3436,"type":"result","duration_ms":173012,"uuid":"a7e75334-21e4-4a49-a9f8-a39d9e6c4a2e","ttft_stream_ms":851,"time_to_request_ms":79,"queued_turn_count":0}
